      "writtenOn": "2025-12-10T13:42:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Let\u0027s keep it simple. We can just copy pkvm_lm_context_param to a local variable instead of accessing it by pointer, right?\n\nFixing it for all uses (by using get/put) is not that hard and I thought I could do it in a simple patch. But auditing each usage and fixing only those which may have a security impact is also fine with me.",
      "parentUuid": "cf3314c2_bd1c5e13",
